  "title": "The Molten Cistern",
  "text": "A cistern full of metal that never cooled, glowing like a sunset, its surface skinned and wrinkled. Ingots float on top like ice on a pond, bobbing gently. The heat makes your eyes water from ten paces away.",
  "options": [
    {
